@startuml
|Coordinator/Administrator|
start
:Enter student and record filters;
|Web UI / API|
:GET /records with query parameters;
|Authentication & Access Control|
if (Authenticated?) then (yes)
  |Search & Reporting|
  :Validate controlled status filters;
  if (Valid filters?) then (yes)
    |Data Access Layer|
    :Query joined records using combined filters;
    |Web UI / API|
    :Show matches;
  else (no)
    |Web UI / API|
    :Show filter error;
  endif
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show authentication error;
endif
stop
@enduml
